; Part of millgui. MIT licence, see millgui/LICENSE.
; MEASURE rotary deflection: o<probe_a_measure_deflection> call [dia]
; [span] [dir]. Needs work Y0 Z0 on the A axis (parallel to X); the probe
; starts above the cylinder near Y0. dia = diameter estimate (> 0), span =
; X distance to the second station (|span| >= 0.1 mm), dir 1 when +A moves
; the top of the work towards the operator, -1 the other way (0 counts as
; 1). At the start X and at start X + span it finds the section centre
; (o<millgui_rotary_station>: Y from two side touches at A +/- 90, Z from
; top touches at A start and A + 180). Reports
; measure_deflect_y_delta_value and measure_deflect_z_delta_value (far
; centre - near centre) and measure_deflect_y_angle_value and
; measure_deflect_z_angle_value (atan(drift / span), degrees). Returns to
; the start X, Y0 and A start with guarded moves. No offset write. Modes
; are restored (M73).
o<probe_a_measure_deflection> sub
o10 if [#<_task> EQ 0]
    o<probe_a_measure_deflection> return
o10 endif
o<millgui_rotary_ready> call [1]
M73
M50 P0
G90 G94
#<dia> = #1
#<span> = #2
#<dir> = #3
o20 if [#<dia> LE 0]
    (ABORT, Diameter estimate must be positive)
o20 endif
o21 if [ABS[#<span>] LT [0.1 * #<_millgui_mm>]]
    (ABORT, Deflection X span must be at least 0.1 mm)
o21 endif
o22 if [#<dir> EQ 0]
    #<dir> = 1
o22 endif
#<a0> = #5423
#<x0> = #5420
o<millgui_rotary_station> call [#<dia>] [#<dir>] [#<a0>]
#<y_near> = #<_millgui_station_y>
#<z_near> = #<_millgui_station_z>
o<millgui_guarded_move> call [#<span>] [0] [0]
o<millgui_rotary_station> call [#<dia>] [#<dir>] [#<a0>]
#<y_drift> = [#<_millgui_station_y> - #<y_near>]
#<z_drift> = [#<_millgui_station_z> - #<z_near>]
; Slope angles against +X (atan of drift / span), whatever the span's sign.
#<sgn> = 1
o30 if [#<span> LT 0]
    #<sgn> = -1
o30 endif
#<y_angle> = [ATAN[#<sgn> * #<y_drift>]/[ABS[#<span>]]]
#<z_angle> = [ATAN[#<sgn> * #<z_drift>]/[ABS[#<span>]]]
(DEBUG, EVAL[vcp.getWidget{"measure_deflect_y_delta_value"}.setValue{#<y_drift>}])
(DEBUG, EVAL[vcp.getWidget{"measure_deflect_z_delta_value"}.setValue{#<z_drift>}])
(DEBUG, EVAL[vcp.getWidget{"measure_deflect_y_angle_value"}.setValue{#<y_angle>}])
(DEBUG, EVAL[vcp.getWidget{"measure_deflect_z_angle_value"}.setValue{#<z_angle>}])
o<millgui_guarded_move> call [0] [0 - #5421] [0]
o<millgui_guarded_move> call [#<x0> - #5420] [0] [0]
G90
o<probe_a_measure_deflection> endsub
M2
